  "notes": "Published via WebBot",
  "content": "<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"embed-html embed col-lg-12\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-c8ff620775\" class=\"cmp-embed\">\n<section class=\"my-4 bg-light\">\n<div class=\"container px-5 py-5\">\n<h1 class=\"mt-0\">Contact us</h1>\n<p>Have a question? Contact us for information on our audits, reports, or other public matters.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-xs-12\">\n<div class=\"cmp-container\">\n<div class=\"nested-columns mwscolumns\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3\">\n<div class=\"embed-html embed section\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-1f670ed7c4\" class=\"cmp-embed\">\n<div style=\"margin-top: 50.0px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"embed-html embed section\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-fdcee02bb4\" class=\"cmp-embed\">\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"embed-html embed section\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-2eb378e407\" class=\"cmp-embed\">\n<h6>Contact us</h6>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/contact-us.html\">Contact us</a>\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled small p-1\">\n<li><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/contact-us.html\">Credentials</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/contact-us.html#regional-offices\">Regional offices</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"my-2\" /><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/contact-us.html#specific-inquiries\">Specific inquiries</a>\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled small p-1\">\n<li><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/contact-us.html#media-relations\">Media relations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/contact-us.html#parliamentary-liaison\">Parliamentary liaison</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/contact-us.html#speaking-invitations\">Speaking invitations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/contact-us.html#international-relations\">International relations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/contact-us.html#other-inquiries\">Other inquiries</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"my-2\" /><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/environmental-petitions.html#contact-petitions\">Environmental petitions</a></div>\n<div class=\"oag-card p-3\">\n<h6 class=\"mt-2\">About us</h6>\n<p class=\"small\">We are committed to transparency, accountability, and the responsible use of public resources through independent audits and expert advice.</p>\n<a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/about-us.html\" class=\"small\">Learn more</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9\">\n<div class=\"embed-html embed section\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-ebe7483ff3\" class=\"cmp-embed\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"embed-html embed section\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-400ad4ea15\" class=\"cmp-embed\">\n<h2 id=\"SP\">Ways of connecting</h2>\n<p>Below is our official contact and address information for communication and correspondence.</p>\n<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd mt-3\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-4 col-lg-4\">\n<article class=\"py-3\"><img alt=\"Emplyee contact icon\" src=\"/content/dam/oag-bvg/core-pages-assets/contact-assets/icons/oag-icon-contact-email-70x70.svg\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mb-1\" />\n<h5>Email</h5>\n<p>To submit general questions and comments about the Office of the Auditor General of Canada, please use this <a href=\"mailto:communications@oag-bvg.gc.ca\">email address</a>.</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-4 col-lg-4\">\n<article class=\"py-3\"><img alt=\"Mail address icon\" src=\"/content/dam/oag-bvg/core-pages-assets/contact-assets/icons/oag-icon-contact-mail-70x70.svg\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mb-1\" />\n<h5>Mail</h5>\n<p>Office of the Auditor General of Canada</p>\n<strong>240 Sparks Street <br />Ottawa <abbr title=\"Ontario\">ON</abbr>  K1A 0G6</strong></article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-4 col-lg-4\">\n<article class=\"py-3\"><img alt=\"Telephone icon\" src=\"/content/dam/oag-bvg/core-pages-assets/contact-assets/icons/oag-icon-contact-phone-70x70.svg\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mb-1\" />\n<h5>Telephone</h5>\n<p>Telephone:<br /><a href=\"tel:188-7615-953\">1-888-761-5953</a></p>\n<p><abbr title=\"telecommunications device service for the hearing impaired\">TTY</abbr> service:<br /><a href=\"tel:613-954-8042\">613-954-8042</a></p>\n<p>Fax:<br />613-957-0474</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"embed-html embed section\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-45c9043c72\" class=\"cmp-embed\">\n<div style=\"margin-top: 40.0px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"embed-html embed section\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-3130cb2322\" class=\"cmp-embed\">\n<div style=\"margin-top: 50.0px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"embed-html embed section\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-8dd249c027\" class=\"cmp-embed\">\n<div style=\"margin-top: 40.0px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"embed-html embed section\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-ea372bffcb\" class=\"cmp-embed\">\n<div style=\"margin-top: 80.0px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"embed-html embed col-lg-12\">\n<div id=\"embed-html-21bfb7fd18\" class=\"cmp-embed\"><hr class=\"my-5\" />\n<h2 id=\"regional-offices\">Regional offices</h2>\n<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd my-5\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card p-4 hght-inhrt\">\n<h5 class=\"mt-0\">Vancouver</h5>\n<p><strong>800 Burrard Street<br />Suite 1906</strong> <br />Vancouver <abbr title=\"British Columbia\">BC</abbr>  V6Z 0B9</p>\n<p>Telephone: <a href=\"tel:6046663596\">604-666-3596</a></p>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card p-4 hght-inhrt\">\n<h5 class=\"mt-0\">Edmonton</h5>\n<p><strong>Canada Place<br />9700 Jasper Avenue<br />Suite 1635</strong><br />Edmonton <abbr title=\"Alberta\">AB</abbr>  T5J 4C3</p>\n<p>Telephone: <a href=\"tel:7084952028\">708-495-2028</a></p>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card p-4 hght-inhrt\">\n<h6 class=\"mt-0\">Montréal</h6>\n<p><strong>1130 Sherbrooke Street West<br />Suite 803</strong> <br />Montréal <abbr title=\"Quebec\">QC</abbr>  H3A 2M8</p>\n<p>Telephone: <a href=\"tel:5142836086\">514-283-6086</a></p>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card p-4 hght-inhrt\">\n<h6 class=\"mt-0\">Halifax</h6>\n<p>Auditor General of Canada c/o Sarah Linders<br />Public Services and Procurement Canada<br /><strong>4th Floor Mailroom, 1713 Bedford Row</strong><br />Halifax <abbr title=\"Nova Scotia\">NS</abbr>  B3J 1T3</p>\n<p>Telephone: <a href=\"tel:18887615953\">1-888-761-5953</a></p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-5\" />\n<div class=\"mb-4\">\n<h2 id=\"specific-inquiries\">Specific inquiries</h2>\n<p>Use this section only if your request truly fits one of the specific inquiry categories; choosing the wrong category may delay your response. If you’re unsure, please submit a general inquiries form instead.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd my-5\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card bg-light py-4\" id=\"media-relations\">\n<details>\n<summary class=\"acc-summary-oag\">\n<h6 class=\"my-3\">Media relations</h6>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"accordion-div\">\n<p>Please direct all media inquiries to the Media Relations team at <a href=\"mailto:infomedia@oag-bvg.gc.ca\">infomedia@oag-bvg.gc.ca</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card bg-light py-4\" id=\"parliamentary-liaison\">\n<details>\n<summary class=\"acc-summary-oag\">\n<h6 class=\"my-3\">Parliamentary liaison</h6>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"accordion-div\">\n<p>Please direct all parliamentary liaison inquiries to the Parliamentary Liaison team at <a href=\"mailto:parliamentaryliaison@oag-bvg.gc.ca\">parliamentaryliaison@oag-bvg.gc.ca</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card bg-light py-4\" id=\"speaking-invitations\">\n<details>\n<summary class=\"acc-summary-oag\">\n<h6 class=\"my-3\">Speaking invitations</h6>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"accordion-div\">\n<p>The Office of the Auditor General of Canada welcomes invitations to participate in interactive discussions, share best practices through presentations and Q&amp;A sessions, and give speeches.</p>\n<p>You can send invitations via our <a href=\"https://forms-formulaires.alpha.canada.ca/en/id/cliaotuzh000axa64okfe3oju\">online speaking engagement request form</a>.</p>\n<p>The information you provide will help us to best respond to your request. Please note that we can accept only a limited number of requests.</p>\n<p>We strongly recommend that you send your invitation at least 2 months before the event date.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card bg-light py-4\" id=\"international-relations\">\n<details>\n<summary class=\"acc-summary-oag\">\n<h6 class=\"my-3\">International relations</h6>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"accordion-div\">\n<p>Please direct all international relations inquiries to the International Relations team at <a href=\"mailto:international@oag-bvg.gc.ca\">international@oag-bvg.gc.ca</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-5\" />\n<div class=\"mb-4\">\n<h2 id=\"other-inquiries\">Other inquiries</h2>\n<p>Use this section to provide details for a faster, more accurate response.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd my-5\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card bg-light py-4\" id=\"atip\">\n<details>\n<summary class=\"acc-summary-oag\">\n<h6 class=\"my-3\">Access to information and privacy inquiries</h6>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"accordion-div\">\n<p>Online: <a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/treasury-board-secretariat/services/access-information-privacy/access-information/request-information.html\">Online inquiry form</a></p>\n<p>Telephone: <a href=\"tel:6139520213\">613‑952‑0213</a>, extension 6455</p>\n<p>Fax: 613‑957‑0474</p>\n<p>Access to Information and Privacy Office <br />Office of the Auditor General of Canada<br />240 Sparks Street<br />Ottawa, Ontario K1A 0G6</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card bg-light py-4\" id=\"req-pub-format\">\n<details>\n<summary class=\"acc-summary-oag\">\n<h6 class=\"my-3\">Request publications or alternative formats</h6>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"accordion-div\">\n<p>To obtain a copy of our recent reports or publications, you can obtain a PDF version of our reports by searching <a href=\"https://www.publications.gc.ca/site/eng/home.html\">Government of Canada Publications</a> or <a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/library-archives.html\">Library and Archives Canada</a>.</p>\n<br />\n<p>Alternate formats are available on request within the following time frames:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Accessible electronic formats, such as rich text format (RTF)—15 days</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Large print—15 days</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Audio—45 days</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Braille—45 days</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</details>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 mb-2\">\n<article class=\"oag-card bg-light py-4\" id=\"complaints-allegations-audits\">\n<details>\n<summary class=\"acc-summary-oag\">\n<h6 class=\"my-3\">Complaints and allegations about audits</h6>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"accordion-div\">\n<p>General complaints must be directed to general inquiries to receive a response, if one is relevant.</p>\n<p>Because of our security protocols, emails containing attachments or links will be automatically deleted.</p>\n<p>For complaints or allegations about the audit work of the Office of the Auditor General of Canada or its audit quality control systems, please see <a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/transparency/complaints-and-allegations-about-the-conduct-of-oag-audits.html\">complaints and allegations</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-5\" />\n<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-5 col-lg-5\">\n<article class=\"hght-inhrt\"><img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"/content/dam/oag-bvg/core-pages-assets/contact-assets/images/oag-image-contact-environmentalpetitions-457x488-x2.jpg\" alt=\"Canadian Landscape with trees and mountians.\" /></article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 col-lg-7\">\n<article class=\"p-4 bg-light hght-inhrt\">\n<h2>Environmental petitions</h2>\n<p>Environmental petitions are a unique way for Canadian residents—acting as individuals or on behalf of an organization—to bring their concerns and questions about environmental issues related to sustainable development to the attention of the federal ministers with a guaranteed response.</p>\n<div><a href=\"/content/canadasite/en/auditor-general/environmental-petitions/environmental-petitions-catalogue.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary px-4 mt-4\">Petitions catalogue </a></div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\"></div>\n</div>"
}